| Field | Value | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| `host` | `localhost` | Safe for local dev; swap for a real hostname in deployment |
| `port` | `8080` | Common unprivileged HTTP alternative to 80/443 |
| `timeout` | `30000` | 30 s is generous enough for slow network calls without hanging forever |
| `retries` | `3` | Standard for transient network failures (with exponential backoff) |
| `debug` | `false` | Off by default so production logs stay clean |

